  - [ ] Update team runbooks
  - [ ] Share access information with team

### Within 1 Week

- [ ] **Performance Baseline**
  - [ ] Collect resource usage metrics
  - [ ] Document baseline CPU/memory usage
  - [ ] Set up resource alerts

- [ ] **Backup Validation**
  - [ ] Perform test restore to dev environment
