sveltehr-backend-xxx                 1/1     Running   0          2m
sveltehr-frontend-xxx                1/1     Running   0          2m
sveltehr-postgres-1                  1/1     Running   0          3m
sveltehr-redis-xxx                   1/1     Running   0          3m
```

