/**
 * Unit Test: Calendar Buffer Calculation
 * Feature: 027-we-need-to
 *
 * Tests for 3-month calendar buffer window calculation and prefetching logic.
 * MUST FAIL until implementation in src/lib/utils/calendar-buffer.ts
