## Type Definitions

### SchemaValidatorConfig

```typescript
interface SchemaValidatorConfig {
  /** PostgreSQL connection string */
  databaseUrl: string;

  /** GraphQL API endpoint */
  apiUrl: string;

  /** Paths to GraphQL operation files */
